OL,3,GNEWSAScottish fashion designer braced
OL,4,Afor 'Claudia effect' after Traitors
OL,5,Aboost
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Scottish fashion designer is braced
OL,8,Fto enjoy the "Claudia effect" after her
OL,9,Fdesigns were worn on Celebrity
OL,10,FTraitors.
OL,12,FJudy R Clark has been secretly working
OL,13,Fwith presenter Claudia Winkleman's
OL,14,Fstylist after realising her dramatic
OL,15,Fcreations were perfect for the show.
OL,17,FSeveral items were hand-delivered under
OL,18,Fstrict conditions and Winkleman was
OL,19,Fseen wearing them on the latest
OL,20,Fepisode.
